msgstr "語言切換"

msgid "Auto Repair & Maintenance"
msgstr "汽車維修與保養"

msgid "Book Service"
msgstr "立即預約"

msgid "Call Now"
msgstr "立即致電"

msgid "Quick info"
msgstr "快速資訊"

msgid "Visit or Contact"
msgstr "到店／聯絡"

msgid "Fast help for urgent issues and easy scheduling for everything else."
msgstr "緊急狀況快速協助，其餘項目也能輕鬆預約。"

msgid "Phone"
msgstr "電話"

msgid "Services"
msgstr "服務項目"

msgid "Everything your vehicle needs—done right."
msgstr "愛車需要的一切服務，一次到位。"

msgid "Clear explanations, quality parts, and workmanship you can trust."
msgstr "清楚說明、優質零件、值得信賴的工法。"

msgid "Get a Quote"
msgstr "取得報價"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "電腦診斷"

msgid "Check engine light, no-start, strange noises—pinpoint the cause with modern tools."
msgstr "引擎燈亮、無法發動、異音等問題，使用現代化設備精準找出原因。"

msgid "Brakes & Safety"
msgstr "煞車與安全"

msgid "Brake pads, rotors, fluid service and inspections to keep you confident on the road."
msgstr "煞車皮、碟盤、煞車油保養與檢查，讓您上路更安心。"

msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "定期保養"

msgid "Oil changes, fluids, filters and scheduled maintenance to prevent bigger repairs."
msgstr "換機油、油水、濾芯與定期保養，預防大修發生。"

msgid "Electrical"
msgstr "電系維修"

msgid "Battery, alternator, starters and charging issues—tested and repaired correctly."
msgstr "電瓶、發電機、啟動馬達與充電系統問題，完整檢測、正確修復。"

msgid "A/C & Heating"
msgstr "冷氣與暖氣"

msgid "Stay comfortable year-round with accurate A/C diagnostics and repairs."
msgstr "透過精準冷氣診斷與維修，四季都舒適。"

msgid "Pre‑Trip Checks"
msgstr "行前檢查"

msgid "Quick inspection before long drives: tires, brakes, fluids and lights."
msgstr "長途出發前快速檢查：輪胎、煞車、油水與燈具。"

msgid "Why choose us"
msgstr "為何選擇我們"

msgid "Modern service with old‑school honesty."
msgstr "現代化服務，老派的誠實。"

msgid "We focus on clear communication, smart diagnostics, and doing the job right the first time."
msgstr "我們重視清楚溝通、精準診斷，並一次把事情做好。"

msgid "Straightforward recommendations (no pressure)."
msgstr "建議透明不施壓。"

msgid "Quality parts and warranty-backed workmanship."
msgstr "優質零件與保固工法。"

msgid "Fast scheduling and status updates."
msgstr "快速預約與進度更新。"

msgid "Contact"
msgstr "聯絡我們"

msgid "Let’s get your car back to 100%."
msgstr "讓愛車回到最佳狀態。"

msgid "Send a message, request a quote, or call us—whatever’s easiest."
msgstr "傳訊息、詢價或直接致電都可以，怎麼方便怎麼來。"

msgid "Tip: add a contact form plugin (e.g., Contact Form 7) and paste its shortcode in the Customizer to show a form here."
msgstr "提示：安裝聯絡表單外掛（例如 Contact Form 7），並在自訂器貼上短代碼即可在此顯示表單。"

msgid "Call"
msgstr "致電"

